<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK FEB DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.90 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK FEB DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.90 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Monday the required daily money market liquidity balance for the</p>
<p>rest of the month was 5.90 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Feb 19			6,800</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Feb		6,346</p>
<p> Average reserves to Feb 14			   6,680</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    5,903</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
